WEBVTT

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:10.080
Haven't you found him yet?

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:14.040
Don't worry, I'll finish him off the second I do.

00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:16.920
You'll do no such thing,
unless you want to make me truly angry.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:19.670
Lighten up. I'm just itching for a murder, is all.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:25.500
An itch I'm looking to scratch real soon.

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:29.960
Whoa, now.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:35.210
We can't let our guard down
until we know exactly what we're dealing with.

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:41.540
And if he turns out to be a threat?

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:48.540
Then I'll dig out his eyes,
skin him alive, tease and torment him...

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:50.830
...and finish him off myself.

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:54.540
Now you've got me even more excited.

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:01.000
Find him?

00:01:01.130 --> 00:01:02.130
Yup.

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:04.540
Sure did.

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:08.790
We've got you now, Yuji the adventurer!

00:01:35.790 --> 00:01:37.960
Maa ikkatte ukenagashite

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:41.130
Nochi no jinsei wa henka shinakute

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:43.290
Mou ikka wa joushuu no te de

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:46.670
Boku no nouryoku wa imada sakanai

00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:51.540
Katou tomosezu makeru koto mo itowanai nara

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:57.290
Mukishitsu na shinjou wa naze toki o utsu

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:03.460
Bokura dare mo ga himetaru chikara o motta monster

00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:09.170
Da toshite mezame saseru koto naku ikitekuno

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:12.460
Oshikonde futa shite

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:15.210
Mou shinsen na kokoro janai

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:20.000
Sore demo kaoiro hitotsu kaezu ni ikiru monster

00:02:21.130 --> 00:02:26.540
Dare mo ga mujikaku no sokojikara o uchi ni shinobaseru

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:30.250
Tsugi wa kimi no ban da

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:36.080
Tachimukaeyo monster

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:42.420
That sure was fun!

00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:44.130
And yummy, too!

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:46.290
Wish we coulda stayed longer!

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:51.040
Once I knew my name was on a hit list...

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:54.080
...I couldn't hang around in Ricaardo any longer.

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:57.540
What?!

00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:00.790
You're already leaving town?!

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:03.420
Something's pulling me away, unfortunately.

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:06.130
Do you have any suggestions on where I should go next?

00:03:06.630 --> 00:03:08.790
Well...

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:11.670
Oh, how about Boginia?

00:03:12.130 --> 00:03:13.130
What's there?

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:15.540
The area's famous for its monster armor.

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:19.170
It's the perfect place for a tamer like yourself.

00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:25.460
If you're going to buy any monster armor there,
I suggest you visit Geigel's workshop.

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:30.670
He's a master craftsman, despite his gruff attitude.

00:03:32.380 --> 00:03:34.790
All right, suppose I'll check it out.

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:39.580
Wonder what this next place'll be like.

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:42.500
I hope its culinary offerings impress!

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:45.420
Same here. Can't wait to find out!

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.880
The whole gang might get even stronger
once we get there.

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:53.210
Yuji, someone's watching us.

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:55.540
Yeah, I noticed.

00:03:56.500 --> 00:04:00.170
I've got my eyes on you, Yuji the adventurer!

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:06.880
Sounds like they've been searching for you.

00:04:18.420 --> 00:04:21.750
Look at this guy, napping without a care in the world.

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:24.710
Still don't think we should finish him here and now?

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:29.750
You know the Guild is starting to grow concerned
about these unusual deaths.

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:34.750
Plus, this Yuji is still only a prospective target.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:40.790
Easy enough to bump him up the list
after we take him out.

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:42.330
Do whatever you want.

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:46.790
But know you'll die by my hands when you do.

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:27.130
Fine. But I'm telling you,
this guy looks like any ordinary tamer.

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:30.790
We're wasting time we could be spending
on other targets.

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:36.750
We will, after we watch him today
and determine him to be no threat to the cause.

00:05:38.210 --> 00:05:42.130
So the wicked Blue Moon of Salvation
spends its days sitting around watching kids, now?

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:45.790
Thought it might be them.

00:05:47.330 --> 00:05:49.500
Leaving Ricaardo was definitely the right move.

00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:58.750
<b>Class: Assassin                                                                                                                                       Class: Twinblade</b>

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:53.920
They sure don't look friendly,
and I wish I could take them down here...

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:58.380
But if they disappear while tracking me,
that will put a bigger target on my head.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:03.080
I need to find a way off that list.

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:13.250
<b>Boginia</b>

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:13.080
Boginia, huh?

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:16.880
Makes sense for a tamer
to come here for monster armor.

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:21.790
See? Straight for Geigel's.

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:25.130
He makes the best monster armor around.

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:29.040
Yuji may be more talented than he looks.

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:34.460
It's hard to see from here.

00:06:37.170 --> 00:06:44.210
He's perusing the wares, and checking the price tag
on something he seems pretty interested in.

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:51.540
Looks like he doesn't have the cash
and is getting shooed off.

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:54.040
Seems he gave up.

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:06.250
Now he bumped into some guy and...

00:07:09.830 --> 00:07:11.130
Seriously...?

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:14.790
Now he's in front of a food stand and...

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:19.670
He only has two coins to his name?

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:28.790
He's too poor to even afford food?

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:33.540
Now he's using his slimes to...

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:38.670
...find coins on the ground?

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:44.540
That's how he uses his tamer skills?

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:54.330
THAT'S really one of our prospective targets?

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:56.750
I know I've seen enough.

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:00.000
I'm not convinced yet.

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:10.130
Guess they need another push.

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:16.580
He's signing up to take down a Rush Bull.

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:19.210
Hardly anything to be impressed by.

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:24.540
Still. This should give us a chance to see him in action.

00:08:37.960 --> 00:08:39.630
Okay, let's do this.

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:43.210
We'll be doing this with no offensive magic today.

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.380
Why?!

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:48.540
If we make this look easy they'll realize what I can do.

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:50.830
Sound reasoning indeed.

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:53.420
How you gonna fight without fighting, though?

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:57.880
Proud Wolf, you know what I am, right?

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:00.000
'Course! You're a tamer!

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:03.210
And do you know how tamers normally fight?

00:09:03.210 --> 00:09:07.080
By using their tamed monsters, yeah?

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:09.380
So you understand, then.

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:12.750
Go get 'em, Proud Wolf.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:16.880
WAIT, ME?!

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:20.290
No way! No how! I can't!

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:35.000
Nooo!

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:41.000
He got it in one hit!

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:42.630
Way to go!

00:09:42.630 --> 00:09:44.710
A mighty fine show!

00:09:44.710 --> 00:09:47.460
Huh? Wait, what?

00:09:47.460 --> 00:09:51.000
Seriously? Did I...? Was that me?

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:59.000
That's right... I used to be strong...

00:10:02.420 --> 00:10:03.830
I was...

00:10:04.880 --> 00:10:06.130
I still am...

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:09.130
Proud Wolf!!

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:42.250
This thing's pretty big for a wolf.

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:45.460
I think it's trying to look threatening.

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:51.750
Magical Net!

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:00.710
Is it trying to say something?

00:11:02.830 --> 00:11:04.210
Monster Telepathy!

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:08.130
Help! Please don't kill me!

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:11.080
I, uh, wasn't planning to.

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:15.000
I just, gah, I uhh... I'm really sorry!

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:18.670
A lowly little wolf like me picking on you?
What was I thinking?

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:21.790
Please, spare me! I'll do whatever you say!

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:25.040
Please! Let me live! Please! Please!

00:11:28.460 --> 00:11:29.710
Uhh...

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:33.330
Mind if I tame you, then?

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:35.920
Sure! By all means!

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:43.330
Was he ever actually strong?

00:11:44.630 --> 00:11:47.130
Guess some things are best left unsaid.

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:53.580
Leave this to me. I'll take care of these runts.

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:07.380
Way to go!

00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:10.540
That wolf can hold its own.

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:14.880
Which means the boy might be
a better tamer than he looks.

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:19.040
That's no good. They're starting to think I'm strong.

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:20.420
Heal!

00:12:24.670 --> 00:12:26.080
They're not done for yet!

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:40.460
Heal!

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:45.170
They just won't give up!

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:46.580
Talk about tough!

00:12:47.710 --> 00:12:50.080
Seriously? Come on!

00:12:50.920 --> 00:12:54.290
Nevermind, guess its bark is worse than its bite.

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:57.000
Kid can't be that great of a tamer.

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:01.500
Perfect, we look weak again.

00:13:04.710 --> 00:13:08.540
So be it. Come at me, then!

00:13:10.210 --> 00:13:13.080
It'll end the same for you every time!

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:19.580
Might take all day at this rate.

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:22.500
Magic Boost! Physical Boost!

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:48.540
Maybe that was a bit much.

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:50.380
It's hard to get this stuff just right.

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:56.210
I should probably give Proud Wolf a buff...

00:13:56.920 --> 00:13:58.540
Magical Boost! Physical-

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:01.790
Yuji! I gotta refuse.

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:07.580
This is a battle between us monsters.

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:13.330
Can't have you stepping in on this one, I'm afraid.

00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:16.080
No, but...

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:22.920
I fight for my namesake!

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:26.920
For the pride of all wolves!

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:48.420
That was awesome!

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:50.210
You're so cool!

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:57.380
Maybe that wolf isn't half bad.

00:14:57.380 --> 00:15:02.290
Can't be all that great if it takes that long
just to finish off a few bulls, though.

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:06.580
Good, looks like they bought it.

00:15:14.710 --> 00:15:15.540
Yuji!

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:18.080
<b>Summon Magic</b>

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:18.080
<b>Summon Sword</b>

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:18.080
<b>Sage Skills</b>

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:18.080
<b>Summon</b>

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:18.920
Summon Sword!

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:40.920
There goes my cover...

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:44.670
Probably wielded this too well.

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:51.420
That kid always have a sword?

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:55.380
No... Can he summon weapons?

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:05.210
Slime...

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:13.710
He didn't look like he knew what he was doing...

00:16:15.880 --> 00:16:18.460
But that blade didn't waver a hair's width.

00:16:21.630 --> 00:16:23.540
None of this adds up!

00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:39.080
Well? Now do you think he's a threat?

00:16:50.130 --> 00:16:51.420
Yuji...

00:16:53.380 --> 00:16:55.000
...is just your ordinary tamer.

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:57.500
Yup. Was thinking the same.

00:16:57.500 --> 00:16:59.880
Sucks we won't get to kill him.

00:17:03.880 --> 00:17:06.500
Let's go report this.

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:14.000
Guess that worked.

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:21.330
Okay, Slime, come on back.

00:17:21.630 --> 00:17:24.420
Yuji, they're still talking.

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:30.080
We're taking down some priest next? Sounds fun.

00:17:30.710 --> 00:17:33.330
What was his name again?

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:36.330
A guy named-

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:50.330
We spent the day surveilling the adventurer named Yuji,
but we believe him no threat to the cause.

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:53.750
Fine work.

00:17:55.540 --> 00:17:59.170
But we now face another threat.

00:18:00.420 --> 00:18:03.130
Messias has fallen.

00:18:03.880 --> 00:18:05.290
It has?

00:18:05.710 --> 00:18:10.000
Not only that, but the Cleansing Flame was used.

00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:14.170
Which means someone set out to destroy the village.

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:16.960
Is the perpetrator our next target?

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:21.670
That much is unclear,
but we believe him to be pulling the strings.

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:25.790
He's always been a shrewd man.

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:29.170
Another plan is now in the works.

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:32.460
Get out there and determine if the target is a threat.

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:33.790
As you wish.

00:18:34.830 --> 00:18:36.210
Do not fail us.

00:18:38.460 --> 00:18:41.330
"Cleanse this tainted world!"

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:50.500
If this next guy is a threat, we're good, right?

00:18:50.710 --> 00:18:52.250
We are.

00:18:52.630 --> 00:18:57.130
We kill him. This priest. Father Steyl.

00:18:59.710 --> 00:19:03.170
It's too dangerous to let these two run loose.

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:22.920
That should keep Father Steyl safe for now.

00:19:23.880 --> 00:19:27.210
But why is the Blue Moon of Salvation out for a priest?

00:19:28.330 --> 00:19:30.330
And one their leader seemed to know?

00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:44.210
Welcome!

00:19:44.670 --> 00:19:47.330
Hey, you're that pauper from the other day!

00:19:47.710 --> 00:19:49.500
I've brought funds this time.

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:55.330
I'm a tamer looking for monster armor
for my friends here.

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:57.880
What? For slimes?

00:19:58.330 --> 00:20:03.830
Go on and get lost. Master Geigel
doesn't make junk for little slimes!

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:06.880
What do you think you're doing?

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:08.000
Master...!

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:10.460
So that's Geigel, then.

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:17.170
This tamer here came asking for slime armor, so I...

00:20:17.170 --> 00:20:19.380
You don't make the calls 'round here!

00:20:19.710 --> 00:20:24.290
I decide who's fit for my wares.

00:20:25.210 --> 00:20:28.000
You the slime tamer?

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:29.080
I am.

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:42.130
You dimwitted fool!

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:46.170
These here are the strongest customers we've ever had.

00:20:46.380 --> 00:20:47.250
What?!

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:50.920
Sure sized us up big with just a look.

00:20:52.130 --> 00:20:58.210
Sorry to say it though, but we don't have
armor here for monsters of this level.

00:20:58.750 --> 00:21:00.210
Are they really that strong?

00:21:01.830 --> 00:21:06.040
I'd have to forge new armor especially for them.

00:21:06.750 --> 00:21:08.040
Would you?

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:10.960
That I can do.

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:15.040
There's just one problem...

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:41.040
<b>EPISODE 7</b>

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:41.040
<b>ASSASSINS IN PURSUIT</b>

00:21:41.380 --> 00:21:43.710
Gohan da yo! Da da da dan!

00:21:43.920 --> 00:21:46.750
Tansaku mo choutatsu mo ote no mono

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:48.130
"Tomodachi takusan tsukretekita yo!"

00:21:49.170 --> 00:21:51.830
Machi made ato ippo no toko de encount

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:53.250
"Haa kufuku de! Chikara ga nee!"

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:54.710
"Kibichii mamono ga jiirojiro!"

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:56.170
"Maji panee! Maji panee!"

00:21:56.170 --> 00:21:56.460
"Yabami yaseimi nirami ga sugomi...!"

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:58.380
"Fumu, koko wa okunote shika nai desuzo...!"
"Yabami yaseimi nirami ga sugomi...!"<b></b>

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:00.000
"Sonnano attakke?"
"Yabami yaseimi nirami ga sugomi...!"<b></b>

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:01.290
"Niigerun da yo!"
"Yabami yaseimi nirami ga sugomi...!"<b></b>

00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:02.290
"Niigerun da yo!"
Shikashi mawarikomarete shimatta<b></b>

00:22:02.290 --> 00:22:05.500
Shikashi mawarikomarete shimatta

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:10.920
Zenmetsu suru to wa nani goto ka!

00:22:12.670 --> 00:22:18.790
Yuushatachi yo tachiagare!

00:22:18.960 --> 00:22:20.210
"Karyoku infure zoukyouyaku"

00:22:20.210 --> 00:22:21.380
"Kameba kamu hodo chou kaifuku"

00:22:21.380 --> 00:22:24.290
Tsuyomi ga tsuyomi ga deruzo

00:22:24.420 --> 00:22:25.670
Happadayo!

00:22:25.670 --> 00:22:27.290
"Itadaitokimashou!"
Happadayo!<b></b>

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:29.630
Gohan da yo! Da da da dan!

00:22:31.130 --> 00:22:36.130
Youyaku aritsuketa gohan ga oishii ne!

00:22:36.250 --> 00:22:38.880
Doukutsu demo mayoi no mori demo

00:22:38.880 --> 00:22:41.880
Aa manpuku manzoku shizen no baikingu

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:46.920
Onaka ga suite wa ikusa ga dekinai ne!

00:22:47.040 --> 00:22:52.080
Ikuzo gattai kougekida! Tobikiri magical tsuyoi yatsu

00:22:52.170 --> 00:22:55.170
Chi o saki hi wo fuke!

00:22:55.170 --> 00:22:56.580
"Hyakuninriki no kyuukyoku mahou da!"

00:22:56.580 --> 00:22:57.960
"Maryoku to cheat no housekibako da!"

00:22:57.960 --> 00:22:59.380
"Shuuen no gouka de ichimoudajin da!"

00:22:59.380 --> 00:23:01.330
"Toiu yume o mitan da ne?"

00:23:01.330 --> 00:23:02.170
CHEST!
"Toiu yume o mitan da ne?"<b></b>

00:23:02.170 --> 00:23:04.790
CHEST!
Yuji! Yuji! Saikyou! Kenja! Yuji! Yuji! Uoo tame me!<b></b>

00:23:04.790 --> 00:23:07.290
Yuji! Yuji! Saikyou! Kenja! Yuji! Yuji! Uoo tame me!

00:23:07.290 --> 00:23:09.630
Gohan da yo! Da da da dan!

00:23:11.500 --> 00:23:14.130
Time for an isekai preview from us reincarnated slimes!

00:23:14.460 --> 00:23:16.880
Give us your worst, nothing stops us!

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:19.330
You'll see us in full action once again next time!

00:23:19.710 --> 00:23:21.420
Hey, wait, did you see that?

00:23:21.420 --> 00:23:22.790
What? Where?

00:23:22.790 --> 00:23:24.210
Can't say I saw anything.

00:23:24.210 --> 00:23:26.080
L-look! There it is again!

00:23:26.080 --> 00:23:27.880
I see nothing whatsoever.

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:30.210
Was it a baddie? A goodie?

00:23:30.210 --> 00:23:32.830
Beats me, but if it's a baddie we gotta beat them, too!

00:23:32.960 --> 00:23:41.040
<b>WE GOT SOME MONSTER ARMOR</b>

00:23:33.080 --> 00:23:35.750
"We got some monster armor!"

00:23:35.750 --> 00:23:37.670
Sounds as if all goes well!
